WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.770
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:01.040 --> 00:04.546
The person I was with earlier was my boyfriend.

3
00:04.546 --> 00:07.326
I won't say a word. Don't worry.

4
00:08.070 --> 00:09.750
I finally said it...

5
00:11.750 --> 00:13.730
It's okay to be a kid.

6
00:13.730 --> 00:16.280
We're going to grow up from here on out.

7
00:19.980 --> 00:22.260
I was so lonely.

8
00:23.690 --> 00:26.750
Sorry. That was kind of heavy, huh?

9
00:27.800 --> 00:29.460
I'll cherish this forever.

10
00:41.380 --> 00:43.960
What's with that guy?

11
00:52.350 --> 00:55.070
What on earth is wrong with him?

12
00:55.070 --> 00:57.730
Man, that's crazy!

13
00:57.730 --> 01:00.030
He calls people late at night,

14
01:01.061 --> 01:03.021
leaves the room a mess,

15
01:04.565 --> 01:06.875
and plays games at full volume!

16
01:14.050 --> 01:16.880
Sounds tough, Harutora.

17
01:20.094 --> 01:22.774
Sorry for disrupting your exam studies.

18
01:22.774 --> 01:25.654
No, it's fine. Make yourself at home.

19
01:26.704 --> 01:30.564
If I keep coming over like this, do you think people will talk?

20
01:30.564 --> 01:32.614
Oh, the other students?

21
01:33.234 --> 01:37.714
It's fine. You're my former roommate.

22
01:39.584 --> 01:43.454
Well, I'd like to tell people someday...

23
01:44.174 --> 01:46.374
But not yet.

24
01:48.484 --> 01:50.084
It's okay.

25
01:50.874 --> 01:53.684
We have this, after all.

26
01:54.334 --> 01:56.554
Stop, that's embarrassing.

27
01:56.554 --> 01:59.554
Then should we come up with a different sign?

28
02:06.854 --> 02:08.194
How about this?

29
02:11.089 --> 02:12.409
This?

30
02:15.714 --> 02:17.254
Sorry...

31
02:17.254 --> 02:20.334
My feelings spilled out just now.

32
02:21.064 --> 02:22.504
I like that.

33
02:24.094 --> 02:27.054
Got it. I'll think about it too.

34
02:28.344 --> 02:31.424
No, I'll think of another method.

35
02:31.424 --> 02:32.631
Huh?

36
02:33.674 --> 02:38.184
I want us to be roommates again no matter what, Sui.

37
02:46.375 --> 02:48.294
[Aoba Dormitory]

38
02:48.294 --> 02:50.462
You're moving back in today?

39
02:50.462 --> 02:51.964
Yes!

40
02:54.007 --> 02:59.596
I threw this evidence at the office and got approved in one try.

41
02:59.596 --> 03:00.889
Huh?

42
03:12.884 --> 03:15.354
What about Naruse?

43
03:16.884 --> 03:18.664
I pushed him onto that guy.

44
03:18.664 --> 03:19.984
What?

45
03:21.614 --> 03:26.324
It turns out those two are gamers.

46
03:26.324 --> 03:27.764
Gamers?

47
03:27.764 --> 03:29.114
Yes.

48
03:29.114 --> 03:32.064
They're apparently into the same game.

49
03:32.064 --> 03:36.204
They hit it off the moment they met.

50
03:36.204 --> 03:38.874
That actually happened?

51
03:38.874 --> 03:41.414
Yes, it actually happened!

52
03:49.855 --> 03:51.455
Sui?

53
03:54.084 --> 03:56.644
Say "welcome back" to me.

54
03:58.734 --> 04:00.064
Huh?

55
04:03.564 --> 04:07.154
I love hearing you say "welcome back".

56
04:14.954 --> 04:17.204
Welcome back, Harutora.

57
04:21.334 --> 04:24.004
I'm home, Sui.

58
05:17.784 --> 05:19.344
A three-way meeting?

59
05:20.134 --> 05:23.754
Yeah, to discuss my future plans next week.

60
05:24.594 --> 05:26.904
You're a senior now, huh?

61
05:26.904 --> 05:29.550
And there's the sports festival before that.

62
05:32.144 --> 05:36.144
Is it your mother who's coming to the meeting?

63
05:36.144 --> 05:37.524
Or your father?

64
05:38.164 --> 05:39.574
My mom.

65
05:39.574 --> 05:40.954
She's really excited.

66
05:40.954 --> 05:43.664
Really? I'd love to meet her.

67
05:46.934 --> 05:49.004
Wait, no, I have practice.

68
05:49.004 --> 05:53.494
R-Right. Another time, then.

69
05:53.494 --> 05:54.985
Yeah.

70
06:00.954 --> 06:05.188
[Parent-Teacher Conference Questionnaire]

71
06:08.774 --> 06:11.194
Why do I feel relieved?

72
06:19.174 --> 06:20.334
[Coming Out]

73
06:20.334 --> 06:24.833
[My parents cried.] [They don't understand.]

74
06:33.054 --> 06:34.824
Now, the race is in its final stage.

75
06:34.824 --> 06:38.324
The front group is speeding up, but he's shooting forward!

76
06:38.324 --> 06:39.674
Like a refreshing breeze!

77
06:39.674 --> 06:43.004
Basketball team anchor, second-year Harutora Kurobe, is flying!

78
06:43.004 --> 06:44.584
Even curves won't slow him down!

79
06:44.584 --> 06:46.524
His lead grows as he shoots straight!

80
06:46.524 --> 06:48.724
The gap keeps getting bigger!

81
06:48.724 --> 06:51.774
He finishes, with a huge margin!

82
06:53.304 --> 06:55.394
That was amazing, Harutora!

83
07:08.764 --> 07:12.766
Man, Harutora was fast.

84
07:12.766 --> 07:14.684
It's Sui!

85
07:14.684 --> 07:17.729
Oh, right, I'm on first-aid duty.

86
07:33.870 --> 07:35.964
Did you make that?

87
07:35.964 --> 07:37.424
For your girlfriend?

88
07:37.424 --> 07:39.634
No, idiot.

89
07:39.634 --> 07:42.504
Not everyone's into girls, you know.

90
07:42.504 --> 07:43.922
Wait...

91
07:59.104 --> 08:00.924
Excuse me.

92
08:02.324 --> 08:04.284
I had a nasty fall.

93
08:04.284 --> 08:08.114
Whoa, that's pretty bad.

94
08:08.114 --> 08:10.274
First, let's rinse it with water.

95
08:10.274 --> 08:11.564
Okay.

96
08:11.564 --> 08:13.256
Ishii.

97
08:13.256 --> 08:16.525
Ishii? Could you help with this?

98
08:17.205 --> 08:18.584
What's wrong?

99
08:18.584 --> 08:21.194
I can't handle blood.

100
08:23.150 --> 08:25.004
Sorry.

101
08:25.004 --> 08:28.800
It's fine. Everyone has things they can't handle.

102
08:30.084 --> 08:32.104
Hold on, let me take a look.

103
08:32.104 --> 08:33.334
Okay.

104
08:35.184 --> 08:37.784
Right, how about this?

105
08:41.684 --> 08:43.364
There!

106
08:43.364 --> 08:44.664
Thank you.

107
08:44.664 --> 08:46.734
- Take care. - Okay.

108
08:47.884 --> 08:49.794
- Be careful. - Okay.

109
09:02.104 --> 09:05.324
Hey, I'm really sorry.

110
09:05.324 --> 09:07.184
No, it's fine.

111
09:07.184 --> 09:09.094
It's not just this.

112
09:09.094 --> 09:12.854
I'm also sorry about what I said in the kitchen.

113
09:15.774 --> 09:20.214
I got scolded by Harutora afterward.

114
09:20.804 --> 09:21.964
Huh?

115
09:23.084 --> 09:24.644
Hey, Harutora.

116
09:25.784 --> 09:27.894
Your roommate's gay, right?

117
09:27.894 --> 09:30.184
Doesn't he come onto you?

118
09:33.324 --> 09:37.484
Hey, the person I like is a guy too.

119
09:39.434 --> 09:41.844
So don't say stuff like that.

120
09:45.134 --> 09:48.744
Sui is a really good person.

121
09:49.994 --> 09:51.144
I...

122
09:51.814 --> 09:57.654
I realized for the first time that I didn't respect our differences.

123
09:59.934 --> 10:03.075
I'm really sorry.

124
10:03.937 --> 10:06.148
N-No, it's okay.

125
10:08.134 --> 10:11.047
He's a good guy, isn't he?

126
10:11.684 --> 10:15.184
Right? You think so too, Ishii?

127
10:15.184 --> 10:16.354
Yes.

128
10:18.824 --> 10:20.134
Ishii.

129
10:20.954 --> 10:25.064
Tsuchiya hurt his leg, so go help him out.

130
10:25.064 --> 10:27.484
O-Okay.

131
10:29.124 --> 10:32.364
Are you okay? I'll come too...

132
10:37.044 --> 10:38.294
Huh?

133
10:46.274 --> 10:48.874
It's just a foot blister.

134
10:52.484 --> 10:56.834
You sounded like you were getting along, so I came to interrupt.

135
11:38.114 --> 11:41.714
We can't do this here, Harutora.

136
11:46.974 --> 11:50.104
Did he say anything rude to you?

137
11:51.764 --> 11:55.204
If he does, let me know. I'll...

138
11:57.584 --> 12:00.204
Hey, you should answer that.

139
12:05.975 --> 12:07.734
[Aya Kurobe: Enjoying the sports festival? Share some photos!]

140
12:07.734 --> 12:09.544
It's from my mom.

141
12:14.544 --> 12:17.194
Wait, you sent her a photo of me?

142
12:17.194 --> 12:18.394
Yes.

143
12:22.924 --> 12:24.314
What's wrong?

144
12:24.314 --> 12:25.944
Oh, nothing.

145
12:26.913 --> 12:30.417
You've been looking down lately.

146
12:31.334 --> 12:32.554
Huh?

147
12:32.554 --> 12:35.586
Like, with the parent-teacher conference.

148
12:37.564 --> 12:39.594
Is something bothering you?

149
12:41.386 --> 12:42.977
Is it about your future?

150
12:45.556 --> 12:47.226
Well...

151
12:57.394 --> 12:59.644
Harutora, your parents...

152
13:01.424 --> 13:04.304
If they find out you have a boyfriend,

153
13:04.944 --> 13:07.274
I wonder how they'd react?

154
13:12.209 --> 13:15.624
"Got it", "Congrats".

155
13:15.624 --> 13:17.964
That was the reaction.

156
13:17.964 --> 13:19.242
Huh?

157
13:21.364 --> 13:22.684
You told them?

158
13:22.684 --> 13:24.434
Yes.

159
13:24.434 --> 13:27.742
My mom asked me over the phone the other day.

160
13:28.485 --> 13:30.734
That's a possibility too?

161
13:31.602 --> 13:36.149
She was watching a drama about a same-sex couple,

162
13:36.149 --> 13:40.609
and thought there might be one or two in the family.

163
13:42.534 --> 13:45.804
"Hey, I have a random question".

164
13:46.704 --> 13:48.894
That was basically how it went.

165
13:48.894 --> 13:51.364
I-I see.

166
13:53.224 --> 13:55.334
Sorry I kept it a secret.

167
13:55.334 --> 13:57.444
I should've told you sooner.

168
13:57.444 --> 14:00.234
No, I'm relieved.

169
14:01.364 --> 14:06.774
It's nice to be accepted by the family of the person I like.

170
14:08.854 --> 14:12.414
By the way, here's what my dad said.

171
14:15.824 --> 14:19.914
"We're ready to welcome him anytime".

172
14:26.434 --> 14:28.174
R-Really?

173
14:29.744 --> 14:31.234
Really?

174
14:31.914 --> 14:33.274
Yes.

175
14:56.944 --> 14:59.907
[Aoba Dormitory]

176
15:01.164 --> 15:04.374
Sui, that hairstyle...

177
15:19.704 --> 15:22.074
Nice to meet you! I'm Sui Kishida.

178
15:22.074 --> 15:24.382
I'm a senior.

179
15:24.382 --> 15:29.614
U-Uh, H-Harutora and I are... dating.

180
15:29.614 --> 15:31.294
I see.

181
15:31.294 --> 15:34.378
I'm Harutora's mom, Aya.

182
15:36.154 --> 15:40.044
Oh no. Are you nervous? That's so cute.

183
15:40.044 --> 15:42.424
Uh, well...

184
15:44.464 --> 15:46.616
This is how she normally is.

185
15:48.174 --> 15:49.674
Where are the others?

186
15:49.674 --> 15:51.304
Dad's over there.

187
15:51.304 --> 15:54.634
It's hard to talk when things get loud.

188
15:54.634 --> 15:57.624
Hey, Sui. Do you have siblings?

189
15:57.624 --> 16:00.764
I'm an only child.

190
16:00.764 --> 16:02.375
An only child...

191
16:03.212 --> 16:04.755
- Hey, you rascals! - It's Harutora!

192
16:04.755 --> 16:06.300
Who's that next to you?

193
16:06.300 --> 16:08.800
- So handsome! - Stop that!

194
16:09.672 --> 16:10.834
He's my boyfriend.

195
16:10.834 --> 16:13.634
- Boyfriend? - He's your boyfriend?

196
16:13.634 --> 16:16.424
Sorry, they're so loud.

197
16:16.424 --> 16:18.384
No, not at all.

198
16:18.384 --> 16:21.134
I don't have siblings, so this is nice.

199
16:21.134 --> 16:23.084
It's like having little brothers.

200
16:23.084 --> 16:25.004
Really?

201
16:25.004 --> 16:26.607
Since you're an only child,

202
16:26.607 --> 16:29.539
I was worried you might not like how noisy we are.

203
16:29.539 --> 16:31.490
I'm so glad!

204
16:31.490 --> 16:34.070
Our home's always crazy,

205
16:34.070 --> 16:36.504
but please come visit anytime.

206
16:38.074 --> 16:39.694
Huh?

207
16:39.694 --> 16:42.444
We really do welcome you anytime.

208
16:43.377 --> 16:46.298
Yes, I'd love to.

209
16:47.724 --> 16:48.995
I'd love to!

210
16:50.564 --> 16:51.684
Hey now...

211
16:51.684 --> 16:54.014
- Sorry. - Boys, come with me now!

212
17:11.324 --> 17:13.892
You have a nice family. They're so welcoming.

213
17:16.534 --> 17:18.274
I've...

214
17:18.274 --> 17:21.434
I've never seen Mom wear makeup before.

215
17:22.694 --> 17:26.904
I think she really wanted you to like her.

216
17:33.284 --> 17:35.284
It's a wonderful thing,

217
17:36.114 --> 17:39.404
being introduced to your boyfriend's family.

218
17:42.544 --> 17:44.384
And one day, I'll...

219
17:45.684 --> 17:46.804
Huh?

220
17:48.074 --> 17:49.474
Nothing.

221
17:53.698 --> 17:55.617
Thank you.

222
18:04.004 --> 18:06.754
That was great.

223
18:06.754 --> 18:09.014
You might get into your first choice.

224
18:09.014 --> 18:12.164
It's too early to relax, Mom.

225
18:13.184 --> 18:17.558
Hey, I'd like to say hello to your roommate too.

226
18:21.804 --> 18:23.978
He has practice today.

227
18:23.978 --> 18:25.714
I see.

228
18:25.714 --> 18:27.974
Sui!

229
18:27.974 --> 18:29.634
Harutora!

230
18:30.424 --> 18:34.184
Are you by any chance Sui's mother?

231
18:34.184 --> 18:35.984
Yes.

232
18:35.984 --> 18:37.444
Nice to meet you.

233
18:37.444 --> 18:40.154
I'm Harutora Kurobe, a second-year.

234
18:40.154 --> 18:41.574
Oh, so you're him?

235
18:41.574 --> 18:42.934
Yes.

236
18:44.264 --> 18:46.204
You're so tall.

237
18:46.204 --> 18:47.954
Like a basketball player.

238
18:47.954 --> 18:50.074
He is one.

239
18:50.074 --> 18:51.804
I'm so glad.

240
18:51.804 --> 18:56.054
I wanted to say hello to you, even just for a second.

241
18:56.054 --> 18:59.774
Wait, you left practice just for that?

242
18:59.774 --> 19:01.364
Yes.

243
19:01.364 --> 19:04.384
She's your one-and-only mother.

244
19:08.914 --> 19:10.054
Ma'am...

245
19:11.104 --> 19:15.294
Sui is always there for me.

246
19:15.924 --> 19:18.684
I'm really glad I met him.

247
19:18.684 --> 19:20.524
Is that so?

248
19:20.524 --> 19:24.644
Please take care of him too.

249
19:24.644 --> 19:25.984
My pleasure.

250
19:28.514 --> 19:30.574
- Isn't that great? - Yeah.

251
19:33.184 --> 19:36.334
Harutora's a great kid.

252
19:36.334 --> 19:40.294
Yeah. He's considerate and kind.

253
19:41.344 --> 19:43.544
He's like the sun.

254
19:44.704 --> 19:46.754
I like that comparison.

255
19:49.174 --> 19:53.094
You seem happier, Sui.

256
19:53.894 --> 19:55.064
Huh?

257
19:55.954 --> 19:59.484
Ever since the second half of middle school,

258
19:59.484 --> 20:02.327
you've shut yourself in your room.

259
20:02.327 --> 20:06.737
And then you suddenly said you wanted to live in a dorm for high school.

260
20:07.754 --> 20:14.284
I was lonely, thinking about how kids leave the nest so quickly.

261
20:16.964 --> 20:20.254
But I'm relieved now.

262
20:20.254 --> 20:22.564
- Mom... - Oh, right.

263
20:22.564 --> 20:25.364
The other day, I ran into Miku.

264
20:26.364 --> 20:29.254
You know, your first love.

265
20:32.294 --> 20:34.044
Sorry, Mom.

266
20:37.724 --> 20:38.874
I...

267
20:41.954 --> 20:45.234
I honestly felt uncomfortable at home.

268
20:51.344 --> 20:56.074
It was painful to keep lying all the time.

269
20:57.684 --> 20:59.244
Lying?

270
21:05.724 --> 21:07.324
The truth is...

271
21:11.714 --> 21:16.014
The truth is, I'm not interested...

272
21:17.444 --> 21:18.974
in girls.

273
21:23.609 --> 21:24.969
I...

274
21:27.203 --> 21:28.978
I'd like to tell people someday...

275
21:28.978 --> 21:31.294
[My parents cried.] [They don't understand.] but not yet.

276
21:31.294 --> 21:33.164
Thanks for telling me.

277
21:33.164 --> 21:35.334
"Got it", "Congrats".

278
21:35.334 --> 21:37.264
That was the reaction.

279
21:37.264 --> 21:42.334
I was able to start caring about myself too.

280
21:44.284 --> 21:46.124
The truth is, I...

281
21:47.214 --> 21:48.714
I like you, Sui.

282
21:48.714 --> 21:51.774
I hate it when people mess with you.

283
21:51.774 --> 21:54.224
This one's scented.

284
21:54.224 --> 21:58.334
I love you so much, Sui.

285
21:58.334 --> 22:03.004
I'll always be by your side.

286
22:06.744 --> 22:09.234
I like men.

287
22:14.224 --> 22:17.034
I'm sorry I never told you.

288
22:17.034 --> 22:21.904
But I really wanted you to understand, Mom.

289
22:21.904 --> 22:23.334
That's why...

290
22:29.224 --> 22:33.544
Our home's always crazy, but please come visit anytime.

291
22:35.304 --> 22:37.294
You're lying, right?

292
23:32.244 --> 23:34.214
You wouldn't understand, Harutora.

293
23:34.214 --> 23:36.314
We just need to give him space.

294
23:36.314 --> 23:40.334
Better to regret doing it than to regret not doing it.

295
23:41.854 --> 23:43.654
I thought you weren't coming.

296
23:43.654 --> 23:46.474
Sorry, I know this is an important time for you.

297
23:46.474 --> 23:49.504
I want you to be happy.

298
23:49.504 --> 23:51.454
It's because of your hard work.

299
23:51.454 --> 23:55.914
My life began after I met you, Sui.

300
23:55.914 --> 23:59.296
I'm glad I was born as me.
